Now let's also look at the proposal images/descriptions more carefully:

Proposal 0: Add onModalWillHide prop to ConfirmModal and BaseModal, which will pass to ReactNativeModal. This prop will help schedule a callback just before the modal hides to dismiss the keyboard by calling Keyboard.dismiss().

Proposal 1: Dismiss keyboard when tapping Remove button, wait for keyboardDidHide, then open modal. Use withKeyboardState.

Proposal 2: UI change - remove delete button from ContactMethodDetailsPage, use long press on ContactMethodsPage.

Proposal 3: Make input lose focus (blur) when remove button is pressed.

