   - However, when the modal closes (onCancel or after deletion), `toggleDeleteModal(false)` is called which sets `isDeleteModalOpen` to false directly, calling `setIsDeleteModalOpen(false)`. This closes the modal. But the keyboard might reappear because the input (`ValidateCodeForm`) is still focused.

